{"title": "Unsettling Visage", "pageid": 39352, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unsettling_Visage", "categories": ["Actions", "Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp/300px-Generic_Control.webp, /w/images/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp/300px-Generic_Control.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Generic_Control.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Unsettling Visage</b> is an action that inflicts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> to the nearby enemies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Exude pure terror, instilling <a href=\"/wiki/Fear\" title=\"Fear\">Fear</a> in your foes. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></span> </dd>         <dt> Details: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft) </dd><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn </dd>\n</dl>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Frightened\">Condition: Frightened</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected creature cannot move. Frightened creatures also have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ability Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>\n</p>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Unused images</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 122px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Unsettling_Visage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Tooltip image\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Unsettling_Visage.webp/180px-Unsettling_Visage.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Unsettling_Visage.webp/270px-Unsettling_Visage.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Unsettling_Visage.webp/360px-Unsettling_Visage.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tooltip image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Unsettling_Visage.webp/180px-Unsettling_Visage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Unsettling_Visage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></sp